@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title LinQuickRec System Architecture

actor Client
participant "Proxy (:8080)" as Proxy
database "Discovery / etcd" as Disc
participant "Feature (:8001)" as Feature
participant "Recall (:8002)" as Recall
actor "vLLM" as vLLM
participant "Precalc (:8003)" as Precalc
database "KVWorker (:31502)" as KV
participant "RankMaster (:8004)" as RM
participant "RankSub (:8005)" as RS

== Service Discovery (cached) ==
Proxy -> Disc: Discover(all downstream services)
Disc --> Proxy: UP instances per service_type

== Request Processing ==
Client -> Proxy: POST /Proxy/Recommend
Proxy -> Feature: Recommend()
Feature --> Proxy: user features

par Parallel via thread pool
  Recall -> vLLM: LLM inference (HTTP)
  vLLM --> Recall: recall candidates
  Precalc -> KV: set precalc tensor (Create+Set)
end

Proxy -> RM: Rank()
RM -> RS: Rank() shard xN
RS -> KV: get precalc tensor
note right: simulate scoring
RS --> RM: scored results
RM --> Proxy: ranked product list
Proxy --> Client: RecommendResponse (candidates)
@enduml
